```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([Process Refund]) --> GetRefund[Get Refund Record]
    GetRefund --> CheckStatus{Refund<br/>Status?}

    CheckStatus -->|Not AUTHORIZED/RETRY| ErrorInvalidStatus[Error: Invalid Status]
    CheckStatus -->|AUTHORIZED or RETRY| UpdateStatus[Update Status to PROCESSING]

    UpdateStatus --> GetTransaction[Get Original Transaction]
    GetTransaction --> CheckMethod{Payment<br/>Method?}

    CheckMethod -->|Lightning| CheckInvoiceAge{Invoice<br/>Age?}
    CheckMethod -->|WebLN| CheckInvoiceAge
    CheckMethod -->|On-Chain| ProcessOnChain
    CheckMethod -->|Other| ProcessOriginal

    CheckInvoiceAge -->|< 1 hour| ProcessLightning[Process Lightning Refund]
    CheckInvoiceAge -->|> 1 hour| ProcessOnChain[Process On-Chain Fallback]

    ProcessLightning --> GenerateInvoice[Generate Lightning Invoice]
    GenerateInvoice --> SendLightning[Send via Lightning Network]
    SendLightning --> LNResult{Success?}

    LNResult -->|Yes| RecordPreimage[Record Preimage<br/>Proof of Payment]
    LNResult -->|No| CheckRetryable{Retryable<br/>Error?}

    ProcessOnChain --> CreateTx[Create On-Chain Transaction]
    CreateTx --> BroadcastTx[Broadcast Transaction]
    BroadcastTx --> OnChainResult{Success?}

    OnChainResult -->|Yes| RecordTxHash[Record Transaction Hash]
    OnChainResult -->|No| CheckRetryable

    ProcessOriginal --> ExecuteRefund[Execute via Original Method]
    ExecuteRefund --> OriginalResult{Success?}

    OriginalResult -->|Yes| RecordProof[Record Proof of Refund]
    OriginalResult -->|No| CheckRetryable

    RecordPreimage --> FeeHandling
    RecordTxHash --> FeeHandling
    RecordProof --> FeeHandling

    FeeHandling[Apply Fee Handling] --> FeeCheck{Fee<br/>Handling?}
    FeeCheck -->|Deducted| DeductFee[Deduct Fee from Refund]
    FeeCheck -->|Absorbed| AbsorbFee[Platform Absorbs Fee]

    DeductFee --> UpdateCompleted
    AbsorbFee --> UpdateCompleted

    UpdateCompleted[Update Status to COMPLETED] --> EmitSuccess[Emit REFUND_COMPLETED Event]
    EmitSuccess --> SendReceipt[Send Receipt to User]
    SendReceipt --> Success([Refund Success])

    CheckRetryable -->|Yes| CheckRetryCount{Retry Count<br/>< Max?}
    CheckRetryable -->|No| UpdateFailed

    CheckRetryCount -->|Yes| ScheduleRetry[Update Status to RETRY<br/>Schedule Next Attempt]
    CheckRetryCount -->|No| UpdateFailed

    UpdateFailed[Update Status to FAILED] --> EmitFailed[Emit REFUND_FAILED Event]
    EmitFailed --> NotifyFailure[Notify User of Failure]
    NotifyFailure --> Failure([Refund Failed])

    ScheduleRetry --> Failure
    ErrorInvalidStatus --> Failure

    style Start fill:#4CAF50
    style Success fill:#4CAF50
    style Failure fill:#F44336
    style ProcessLightning fill:#2196F3
    style ProcessOnChain fill:#FF9800
    style ProcessOriginal fill:#9C27B0
    style FeeHandling fill:#FFC107
```
